  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "No such <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> exists",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>",
