      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>From equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
